    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mitchell Douglas are pleased to present this spacious family home for sale.\r\nThis property is only minutes walk from a wide range of amenities, making it\r\nperfect for modern day living.\r\nExtended and upgraded in recent years , the accommodation comprises of\r\na wide welcoming hallway with storage space, livingroom with feature ceiling\r\ncoving and fireplace, kitchen/diner with a wide range of floor and wall units,\r\nceiling coving, fireplace and double doors to a sunny rear garden.\r\nUtility area, plumbed for washing machine, downstairs bathroom with shower\r\nand home office/4th. Bedroom.\r\nUpstairs there are 3 further bedrooms , two with built-in wardrobes and master\r\nbedroom is ensuite and family bathroom.\r\nOff street parking to front with parking for 3 cars, gated side entrance leading\r\nto a south facing rear garden with patio area and shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway with storage space\r\n\r\nLivingroom with feature ceiling coving and fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner - fitted with a wide range of floor and wall\r\nunits, stainless steel sink and drainer, plumbed for dishwasher\r\nFeature fireplace and ceiling coving.  Double doors to\r\na sunny rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility area -\r\nwith sink and drainer, plumbed fo washing machine\r\nGas boiler\r\n\r\nBathroom -\r\nFully tiled.\r\nwith 'Triton' shower/Cubicle, w.c. & w.h.b.\r\n\r\nOffice/4th. Bedroom\r\n\r\nUpstairs-\r\n\r\n3 further bedrooms, two with built-in wardrobes.\r\nMaster bedroom is ensuite fully tiled with\r\na shower/screen, w.c.& w.h.b.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - fully tiled\r\nwith shower/screen, w.c. & w.h.b.\r\n\r\nHeating -\r\nGas fired central heating\r\n\r\nOutside -\r\n\r\nGenerous parking to front with side gate.\r\nSunny rear gardens with patio area and garden shed."
      },
      {
